## blocks-world-look-ahead-state-eval: blocks world under the world conventions (world conventions, ^environment none)
## move-block ties are evaluated by look-ahead (selection-world)

## Shared Soar library (Soar/soar-library, v2.32); the path assumes this folder is in Tasks/Families/<family>/world/<variant>
pushd "../../../../../Soar/soar-library"
source soar-library.soar
popd

## Task settings (after the library, which sets its own defaults)
chunk always
chunk add-osk on
multi-attributes object 5
rl --set learning on
rl --set learning-rate 0.300000
rl --set discount-rate 0.900000
indifferent-selection --epsilon-greedy

source initialize-blocks-world.soar
source elaborations.soar
source move-block.soar
source state-evaluation.soar
